{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:761bde4773e23467","name":"RX-7246","source":{"id":"source:reference-761bde4773e23467","title":"RX-7246","revision":21732,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:22:33Z","sha256":"5328f5c067f1048b7355861c19a9716daad13bd68f7ac5ed36ad887f9a30ed00","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21732","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=RX-7246&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-761bde4773e23467","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["A Wretched Hive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/A_Wretched_Hive","referenceId":"reference:499e9f32005279b4"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Hutt Kajidics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Hutt_Kajidics","referenceId":"reference:3f107406b356c3df"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["The five gladiators are an odd mix, making a team that seems as mismatched as it is diverse. Three ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gamorreans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gamorreans"}," wielding ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vibro-Axes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vibro-Axes"}," snort and drool hungrily, pounding on their armored chests and looking as though they were preparing for a feast. A sly-looking ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rodian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rodian","referenceId":"reference:26980c5af3a71c5b"}," paces back and forth casually, gripping a blaster at his hip, clenching and unclenching his fist as he waits for the fight to start. A cobbled-together Battle Droid with three photoreceptors and a massive ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade Launcher"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade_Launcher","referenceId":"reference:da6a8268b875d982"}," stands stock still, its only movement the occasional twitch of an electronic eye swiveling to examine you from a different angle."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Darga the Hutt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darga_the_Hutt","referenceId":"reference:cf39a7b12acc3031"}," has a crop of interesting and dangerous gladiators, culled from the ranks of his previous teams and as eclectic as they come. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Karg Brothers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Karg_Brothers","referenceId":"reference:0aba26f3069fa988"}," are three ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gamorreans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gamorreans"}," who may or may not really be brothers; no one has dared investigate the claim further. They specialize in melee combat, wielding extremely deadly ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vibro-Axes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vibro-Axes"},", but they use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Balls"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Balls"}," as ranged weapons. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rodian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rodian","referenceId":"reference:26980c5af3a71c5b"}," gladiator ",{"tag":"a","children":["Zayda"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Zayda","referenceId":"reference:e58e572c8a134216"}," is an exile from his homeworld who tried his hand at bounty hunting before realizing that he just wanted to blast people for a living. His personal Combat Droid assistant, RX-7246, is a custom-made Battle Droid with an extensive library of heavy weapon combat routines. These five gladiators have already survived several rounds in the arena against other opponents and are eager to prove themselves against the heroes.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["RX-7246 Statistics (CL 3)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["4th-Degree Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/4th-Degree_Droid"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https:/